msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Exame {#exam}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Quantum business foundations, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training linked below. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. Once you have passed the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Para conquistar o seu badge de Quantum Business Foundations, faça o exame no IBM&reg; Training pelo link abaixo. Este exame deve ser realizado após a leitura das lições deste curso. Após passar no exame, você será notificado pela Credly de que ganhou o badge.\n"

